 카메라</span></h1>\r\n        <p class=\"oa6-desc\">더 강력해진 성능으로 돌아온 액션의 완성.</p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/osmo%20action6/JPG_1.jpg\" class=\"oa6-full-img\" alt=\"01_메인비주얼\">\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <section class=\"oa6-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"oa6-subtitle\">OFFICIAL INTRODUCTION</h3>\r\n        <h2 class=\"oa6-title\">Built to Lead the Scene</h2>\r\n        <div class=\"oa6-video-container\">\r\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XI7nlAaf4iA?si=mLv4HCM6-4jym8Ip;modestbranding=1\" title=\"Osmo Action 6 Introduction\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\">\r\n            </iframe>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <section class=\"oa6-section\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"oa6-title\">Osmo Action 6를 선택해야 하는<br><span class=\"oa6-highlight\">6가지 이유</span></h2>\r\n        <p class=\"oa6-desc\">가변 조리개, 240분 배터리, 1/1.1인치 센서 등 혁신적인 기능을 한눈에 확인하세요.</p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/osmo%20action6/JPG_2..jpg\" class=\"oa6-full-img\" alt=\"02_6가지특징\">\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <section class=\"oa6-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"oa6-subtitle\">IMAGING SYSTEM</h3>\r\n        <h2 class=\"oa6-title\">더 넓은 시야를 위한 <span class=\"oa6-highlight\">업그레이드</span></h2>\r\n        <p class=\"oa6-desc\">\r\n            DJI 최초의 가변 조리개와 새로운 1/1.1인치 센서 탑재.<br>\r\n            SuperNight 모드로 야간에도 대낮처럼 선명한 4K 120fps 영상을 담아냅니다.\r\n        </p>\r\n        <img src=\"http://dronetr7262.godomall.com/data/goods/260115/osmo%20action6/JPG_3..jpg\" class=\"oa6-full-img\" alt=\"03_이미징시스템\">\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <section class=\"oa6-section\">\r\n        <h3 class=\"oa6-subtitle\">STABILIZATION</h3>\r\n        <h2 class=\"oa6-title\">과감하게, <span class=\"oa6-highlight\">흔들림 없이</span></h2>\r\n        <p class=\"oa6-desc\">\r\n            RockSteady 3.0+와 360° HorizonSteady 기술로 어떤 움직임도 부드럽게